OL,3,GNEWSASuspected arson attacks at
OL,4,Arefurbished play park
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo "deliberate" fires in the space of
OL,7,Fdays have destroyed equipment at a
OL,8,Fnewly refurbished play park.
OL,10,FMiddlesbrough councillor Graham Wilson,
OL,11,Fwho represents Brambles and Thorntree,
OL,12,Fsaid parents were furious about the
OL,13,Fsuspected arson at Spider Park, off
OL,14,FColmore Avenue.
OL,16,FCleveland Fire Brigade said it was
OL,17,Fcalled to the park on 10 November to
OL,18,Ffind equipment "well alight" and again
OL,19,Fthree days later to "large amounts of
OL,20,Frubbish and plastic" on fire. Both were
OL,21,Fbelieved to be deliberate.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
